    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOA102 · Assessment 1/7</span>\n<h2>01 Practice exercises after visiting 02 museums</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13352 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOA102 · Đầu điểm 1/7</span>\n<h2>01 Practice exercises after visiting 02 museums</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13352 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: in class Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Essay<br>Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Essay Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Chapter I-VI/ Part 2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Essay exercise: Each team choose a work, author, or period of art observed during an extracurricular activity to analyze and criticize to clarify the aesthetic value and characteristics of Vietnamese art.<br>Students are allowed to use AI tools during the assignment.<br><br>Formal Requirements – Museum Visit Essay<br>1. Length &amp; Format<br><br>Length: 1200–1500 words (excluding references).<br>Format: Word or PDF.<br>Font: Times New Roman or Arial, size 12, line spacing 1.5.<br>Margins: A4 paper, 2.5 cm on all sides.<br>Page numbers: Bottom right corner.<br><br>2. Structure of the Essay<br>Title Page: Include the student’s full name, class, instructor’s name, course title, and submission date.<br>Introduction (≈10–15% of essay)<br>Body (≈70–75% of essay)<br>Conclusion (≈10–15% of essay)<br>References: Use APA 7th edition citation style (minimum of 3 scholarly sources, including books, journal articles, or reliable academic resources).<br><br>3. Academic Requirements<br>Proper in-text citations are used whenever ideas, data, or information are used.<br>No plagiarism (similarity &lt; 20%).<br>The essay should demonstrate:<br>Knowledge of Vietnamese art.<br>Ability to analyze, compare, and evaluate.<br>Critical thinking and academic writing skills.<br>Submitiob format:<br>Essay - Format Files: word/PDF<br>A.i. Usage log: Format Files: .docx/PDF</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">A.i. Usage log: Students are encouraged to use it during their assignments. If used, an explanation must be submitted according to the following requirements: (State AI tools: Name, role, and stage of use; adhere to AI ethics and technical principles.<br>Analyze support: Specify the level of AI contribution (e.g., search, image generation, content editing, visualization).<br>Self-assess: Assess the balance between team/individual contributions and AI, ensuring humans play a central role.<br>Group size: 5-7 people</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=HOA102\">Exam Room — HOA102</a> (1 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=HOA102\">Phòng thi — HOA102</a> (1 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
