    "description": "Progress test 2 10.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOA102 · Assessment 6/7</span>\n<h2>Progress test 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13352 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOA102 · Đầu điểm 6/7</span>\n<h2>Progress test 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13352 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Week 10 in class Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO4, LO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Multiple choicesMarked by Computer<br>Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Multiple choice (&lt; 20 questions) or essay (1-2 questions) or 1 practice painting simulated art styles on paper, computer or wood. Individual: 1 Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Chapter I-VI/ Part 2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">'Option 1: '- Guided by instructor. &quot;Multiple choice (&lt; 20 questions) or essay (1-2 questions), or painting (1 work)<br>Individual: 45-60'&quot;<br>- Student must finish progress test 1 and submit the result to the lecturer in class.<br>Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 32 — FINAL REVIEWS; Q&amp;A</li><li>Session 33 — PROGRESS TEST 1 (in 30 minutes)</li><li>Session 59 — FINAL REVIEWS; Q&amp;A</li><li>Session 60 — PROGRESS TEST 2 (in 30 minutes)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 32 — FINAL REVIEWS; Q&amp;A</li><li>Buổi 33 — PROGRESS TEST 1 (in 30 minutes)</li><li>Buổi 59 — FINAL REVIEWS; Q&amp;A</li><li>Buổi 60 — PROGRESS TEST 2 (in 30 minutes)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=HOA102\">Exam Room — HOA102</a> (1 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=HOA102\">Phòng thi — HOA102</a> (1 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
